            "line": 166,
            "text": "theorem sum_residual_le {q : ℕ} {T S' : ℝ → ℂ} {m A : ℂ} {β D E F : ℝ}\n    (hD : ∀ α, ‖T α - S' α‖ ≤ D) (hD0 : 0 ≤ D)\n    (hE : ∑ b ∈ Bset q, ‖S' ((b : ℝ) / q + β) - m * S' β‖ ^ 2 ≤ E ^ 2)\n    (hF : ‖S' β - A‖ ≤ F) :\n    ∑ b ∈ Bset q, ‖T ((b : ℝ) / q + β) - m * A‖ ^ 2 ≤\n      3 * (q.totient * D ^ 2 + E ^ 2 + q.totient * ‖m‖ ^ 2 * F ^ 2) :=",
